# Air Data Processing Module

## Purpose

Convert pressure measurements into flight parameters.

## Inputs

- Differential Pressure
- Static Pressure
- Temperature

## Outputs

- Airspeed
- Altitude
- Dynamic Pressure
- Static Pressure

## Equations

### Airspeed

V = √(2q/ρ)

### Altitude

Altitude = 44330 × (1 − (P/P₀)^0.1903)
